  "id": "yogurt-marinated-chicken-shawarma",
  "name": "Yogurt-Marinated Chicken Shawarma",
  "subtitle": "Spiced chicken with a tangy yogurt marinade",
  "description": "Thin chicken breasts are marinated with yogurt, lemon, vinegar, garlic, and warm spices, then cooked until tender and safely done.",
